%!PS
/r { 0 0 3 -1 roll 1 rectfill } def
/p { 1 1 rectfill } def
/b { { 1 } { 0 } ifelse r } def
gsave /DeviceCMYK setcolorspace << /ImageType 1 /Width 1 /Height 1 /BitsPerComponent 8 /Decode [0 1 0 1 0 1 0 1] /ImageMatrix [1 0 0 -1 0 1] /DataSource <00ff0000> >> image grestore
gsave [/Separation /S /DeviceCMYK {0 0 0}] setcolorspace << /ImageType 1 /Width 1 /Height 1 /BitsPerComponent 8 /Decode [0 1] /ImageMatrix [1 0 0 -1 0 1] /DataSource <80> >> image grestore
